# Script output. Everything in here is regenerated by running the analysis.
# Uncomment if you would rather the repo carry only code.
# figures/

# The analysis dataset. It contains first_name and country, which together are
# more identifying than the SHA-256 hashing of profile_url removes. first_name
# is used only by the (already-completed) gender imputation step, so a
# published copy could drop that column.
# upwork_pooled.csv
